[02:29.95]Where were we walking together,
{"我们曾并肩同行的地方"}
[02:31.00]I will see you in the end,
{"终局之时我将与你相见，"}
[02:33.19]I'll take you to where you've never been,
{"带你去往从未踏足之地，"}
[02:35.69]And bring you back again,
{"再将你安然带回人间，"}
[02:37.40]Listen to me with your eyes,
{"用你的双眼倾听我言，"}
[02:39.31]I'm watching you from the sky，
{"我正从苍穹将你凝望，"}
[02:40.23]If you forget I'll fade away,
{"若你遗忘我便消散，"}
[02:42.00]I'm asking you to let me stay,
{"恳求你允我驻足停留，"}
[02:45.36]So bathe me in your magic light,
{"让我沐浴你的魔法光芒，"}
[02:47.33]And keep it on in darkest night,
{"至暗时刻也永不熄灭，"}
[02:48.44]I need you here to keep me strong,
{"需你在此赐我力量，"}
[02:50.05]To live my life and sing along,
{"方能度日且随声吟唱，"}
[02:51.88]I'm waiting with you wide awake,
